  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ど、どうしためぐる\r\nずいぶん疲れてるみたいだが……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ！？　そ、そんなことないよ！！\r\nほら！　元気いっぱいだから心配しないで！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……無理はしなくていいんだぞ\r\n最近は仕事続きだったからな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いくつかキャンセルして\r\n休みをとろうか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……！　ありがとう……でも、大丈夫だよ\r\nキャンセルはしたくない",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって、自分でやりたいって言ったことばっかだから……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それに、プロデューサーがせっかく\r\nお仕事取ってきてくれたのに、そんなこと……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺のことなんて気にする必要は……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、電話だ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0103",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "出てもいいぞ\r\nこっちの件はあとで話そう",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "う、うん。ありがとう……\r\n……もしもし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……うん。……うん\r\n……分かった。じゃあ、また次のお休みにね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……次の休みになにかあるのか……？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん。……友達から試合に出てほしい\r\nってお願いされたんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ちょっと待て\r\nめぐる、もしかしてまだ助っ人を？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あはは……前より回数は減っちゃったけどね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "その分、予定が合う日は頑張りたいんだ\r\nわたし、みんなの役に立ちたいから……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうは言うけどな……こんなこと続けてると、\r\nそのうち身体を壊すぞ？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……っ……\r\nごめんなさい……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしもね、ちゃんと選ばなきゃって思ってるんだよ\r\nでも、アイドルのお仕事も友達も、どっちも大切で……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……どっちかなんて選べなくなって、それでここまで……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "どっちも選んじゃ\r\nダメなのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "みんなもめぐるを\r\n大事に思ってる",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "今までよく頑張ったな！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040150,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どっちも大切なんだろ？\r\nなら、諦めちゃダメだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふたつを両立できる道を探そう\r\nな？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー……！\r\n……でも、見つかるかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はわからない\r\nでも今度は、俺も一緒に探すから",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一人きりで頑張るよりはずっとマシなはずだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……えへへ、こんなことなら、\r\nもっと早くプロデューサーに相談すればよかったな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし。じゃあめぐるもちゃんと納得できるように、\r\n二人でいろいろと考えてみるか！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！\r\n……ありがとう、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040180"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるの友達だって、めぐるには\r\n無茶してほしくないって思ってるはずだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も同じだから分かる\r\nつらそうなだけの姿なんて見たくないんだよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……そうなんだね。わたし、\r\nわたしが頑張れば、みんなのためになると思ってた……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だけど、違ったんだね\r\n反対に、みんなに心配かけちゃってたんだ……",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……でも、それでもやっぱり、\r\nアイドルも友達も、どっちかを選ぶことは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なら、一緒に考えていこう",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるがみんなのために頑張ろうと思ったみたいに\r\nめぐるの力になりたいと思う人間もいるってことだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "無茶にならずに、両立ができる方法を\r\n一緒に探そう",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー……\r\nうぅ～っ、ありがとー！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……一緒に頑張っていかなくちゃな！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040270,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、怒らないの……？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事で手を抜いていたら怒っただろうな\r\nでも、めぐるは立派にやってきただろ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たしかに無理をし続けてきたのは\r\n褒められたことじゃないけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでも仕事も友達付き合いも続けようとした、\r\nめぐるの努力を、俺は素直にすごいと思うよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001040290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300104/1003001040290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから俺も、めぐるの力になりたいな\r\nめぐるが守ろうとしてきたものを一緒に守りたいんだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺と一緒に考えよう\r\nアイドルと友達、どっちも両立できる方法を！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
